          "path": "_m/u/1/0/k/rochester-castle-wp/chinese-dragon-in-rochester-ca.jpg",
          "filename": "Chinese Dragon in Rochester Castle Gardens - geograph.org.uk - 1418266.jpg",
          "caption": "Chinese Dragon in Rochester Castle Gardens Medway Mile is a mass fun run around Rochester City as a lead up to the 2012 Olympics. Competitors signed-up received a free t-shirt (red,blue,yellow, green or black). The elite competitors raced around at 7pm. The Fun runners ran at 7.30, after a mass aerobic warm-up in Rochester Castle Gardens. A Chinese dragon team also ran the mile as well, this is close to the end of the mile in the Castle gardens.",
          "alt": "Chinese Dragon in Rochester Castle Gardens Medway Mile is a mass fun run around Rochester City as a lead up to the 2012 Olympics. Competitors signed-up received a free t-shirt (red,blue,yellow, green or black). The elite competitors raced around at 7pm. The Fun runners ran at 7.30, after a mass aerobic warm-up in Rochester Castle Gardens. A Chinese dragon team also ran the mile as well, this is close to the end of the mile in the Castle gardens.",
          "width": 640,
          "height": 480,
          "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
          "license": "CC BY-SA 2.0",
