          "filename": "Medway Milers in Rochester Castle Gardens - geograph.org.uk - 1418257.jpg",
          "caption": "Medway Milers in Rochester Castle Gardens Medway Mile is a mass fun run around Rochester City as a lead up to the 2012 Olympics. Competitors signed-up received a free t-shirt (red, blue, yellow, green or black). The elite competitors raced around at 7pm. The Fun runners ran at 7.30, after a mass aerobic warm-up in Rochester Castle Gardens. The competitors were organised into Runners, Joggers and Walkers general groups, before leading to the start line in Boley Hill.",
          "alt": "Medway Milers in Rochester Castle Gardens Medway Mile is a mass fun run around Rochester City as a lead up to the 2012 Olympics. Competitors signed-up received a free t-shirt (red, blue, yellow, green or black). The elite competitors raced around at 7pm. The Fun runners ran at 7.30, after a mass aerobic warm-up in Rochester Castle Gardens. The competitors were organised into Runners, Joggers and Walkers general groups, before leading to the start line in Boley Hill.",
